{
  "sourceCommit": "50d5aa61ce2f74e3b734de4f8396655ee76177b6",
  "html": "<div id=\"readme\" class=\"md\" data-path=\"README.md\"><article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">MageOS_InlineDocs</h1><a id=\"user-content-mageos_inlinedocs\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: MageOS_InlineDocs\" href=\"#mageos_inlinedocs\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In-admin documentation for <strong>Magento / Mage-OS</strong>: a small marker next to a\n<strong>Stores → Configuration</strong> field opens a documentation card explaining what that\nsetting actually does — the field's own label as the heading, a one-line summary, a\nfuller explanation, and the owning module. The field's config path is a\ncopy-to-clipboard button in the header.</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/12799619/680370415-58692d84-33db-48e3-9693-30e58d5e5cc3.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..dxTEiWLcG0EmUfMOK6mlWyv0fun4R2MFpJ_Sa7ysv0w\"><img width=\"1342\" height=\"528\" alt=\"inline_docs\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/12799619/680370415-58692d84-33db-48e3-9693-30e58d5e5cc3.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..dxTEiWLcG0EmUfMOK6mlWyv0fun4R2MFpJ_Sa7ysv0w\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 528px;; aspect-ratio: 1342 / 528; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The notes <strong>ship inside the module</strong> and are served locally. There is no external\ndocumentation service, no API token, and no HTTP call on page load — so it is safe\nto install anywhere and it never depends on anything being reachable.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A marker appears beside any field this module has a note for. Where a field has no\nnative help, the card is the only documentation it gets; where Magento already ships\na brief <code>&lt;comment&gt;</code>, the card sits alongside it and goes deeper.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">What ships with it</h2><a id=\"user-content-what-ships-with-it\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: What ships with it\" href=\"#what-ships-with-it\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Notes for <strong>~7,400 Mage-OS / Magento core configuration fields</strong> — effectively the\nwhole of <strong>Stores → Configuration</strong> for core. Each carries a one-line <strong>summary</strong> and\nan optional fuller <strong>usage</strong> explanation, with the owning module named in the footer\nand the config path available as a copy button.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Nine high-traffic sections — Inventory, Sales, Catalog, Customer, Checkout, Payment,\nShipping, General and Web — are authored with prose grounded in each field's source\nclasses; the rest carry concise generated notes. The aim is a short, high-signal note\nper field — what the setting does and what isn't obvious from its label — rather than\nrestating the dropdown options or dumping technical metadata into the popover.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">How a field is matched to a note</h2><a id=\"user-content-how-a-field-is-matched-to-a-note\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: How a field is matched to a note\" href=\"#how-a-field-is-matched-to-a-note\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Magento renders each config field with <code>id=\"section_group_field\"</code>, built by\n<code>Config\\Block\\System\\Config\\Form::_generateElementId()</code> as\n<code>str_replace('/', '_', $path)</code>. That transformation is <strong>lossy</strong> — field names\ncontain underscores — so the path can't be reconstructed from the id with any\ncertainty.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">So this module never tries. The page reports the element ids it can see; the\nmodule matches them against ids recorded in <code>inline_docs.xml</code>. A lookup, not a\nguess. (The schema requires each <code>id</code> to be unique, so a lookup never collides.)</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Where the notes come from</h2><a id=\"user-content-where-the-notes-come-from\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Where the notes come from\" href=\"#where-the-notes-come-from\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Every module may ship an <code>etc/inline_docs.xml</code>. They are validated against\n<code>inline_docs.xsd</code>, merged across all modules, and cached — exactly like Magento's\nown XML config types. So a third-party module can document its own fields simply\nby shipping one.</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-text-xml notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"&lt;config xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation=&quot;urn:magento:module:MageOS_InlineDocs:etc/inline_docs.xsd&quot;&gt;\n    &lt;field id=&quot;cataloginventory_options_show_out_of_stock&quot;\n           module=&quot;Magento_CatalogInventory&quot;\n           section=&quot;Inventory&quot;\n           path=&quot;cataloginventory/options/show_out_of_stock&quot;&gt;\n        &lt;summary&gt;Shows out-of-stock products in catalog listings and search.&lt;/summary&gt;\n        &lt;usage&gt;&lt;![CDATA[&lt;p&gt;When off, out-of-stock products stay reachable by their direct\n            URL but drop out of listings and search. Changing it reindexes the catalog,\n            so the storefront keeps the old behaviour until reindexing completes.&lt;/p&gt;]]&gt;&lt;/usage&gt;\n    &lt;/field&gt;\n&lt;/config&gt;\"><pre>&lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">config</span> <span class=\"pl-e\">xsi</span><span class=\"pl-e\">:</span><span class=\"pl-e\">noNamespaceSchemaLocation</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>urn:magento:module:MageOS_InlineDocs:etc/inline_docs.xsd<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>&gt;\n    &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">field</span> <span class=\"pl-e\">id</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>cataloginventory_options_show_out_of_stock<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n           <span class=\"pl-e\">module</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Magento_CatalogInventory<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n           <span class=\"pl-e\">section</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>Inventory<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n           <span class=\"pl-e\">path</span>=<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>cataloginventory/options/show_out_of_stock<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>&gt;\n        &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">summary</span>&gt;Shows out-of-stock products in catalog listings and search.&lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">summary</span>&gt;\n        &lt;<span class=\"pl-ent\">usage</span>&gt;<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">&lt;![CDATA[</span>&lt;p&gt;When off, out-of-stock products stay reachable by their direct</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">            URL but drop out of listings and search. Changing it reindexes the catalog,</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">            so the storefront keeps the old behaviour until reindexing completes.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"pl-pds\">]]&gt;</span></span>&lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">usage</span>&gt;\n    &lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">field</span>&gt;\n&lt;/<span class=\"pl-ent\">config</span>&gt;</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Only <code>summary</code> is required; <code>usage</code> is optional, so a field may carry a one-liner or\na short card.</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong><code>summary</code></strong> — the one-line lead shown bold at the top of the card (also the best\ncandidate for the field's own native <code>&lt;comment&gt;</code>).</li>\n<li><strong><code>usage</code></strong> — the fuller explanation. May carry a small set of inline HTML\n(<code>p</code>, <code>ul</code>/<code>ol</code>/<code>li</code>, <code>code</code>, <code>strong</code>, <code>em</code>, <code>a</code>, <code>br</code>), authored in CDATA.</li>\n<li>Attributes: <strong><code>id</code></strong> (the DOM join key, required), <strong><code>module</code></strong> and <strong><code>section</code></strong>\n(shown in the footer), <strong><code>path</code></strong> (offered as a copy-to-clipboard value in the\nheader), and an optional <strong><code>url</code></strong> for the \"Full documentation\" link.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The bundled core notes are generated by the companion\n<a href=\"https://github.com/nicolasperic/magento-doc-generator\">magento-doc-generator</a>:\ndeterministic extraction from each module's <code>system.xml</code> and the live, merged admin\nconfig (so <code>path</code> and module are read, not guessed) → grounded prose → <code>inline_docs.xml</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Install</h2><a id=\"user-content-install\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Install\" href=\"#install\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"composer require mage-os-lab/module-inline-docs\nbin/magento module:enable MageOS_InlineDocs\nbin/magento setup:upgrade\nbin/magento cache:flush\"><pre>composer require mage-os-lab/module-inline-docs\nbin/magento module:enable MageOS_InlineDocs\nbin/magento setup:upgrade\nbin/magento cache:flush</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Then turn it on: <strong>Stores → Configuration → Advanced → Inline Documentation →\nEnable Inline Documentation → Yes</strong>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Configuration</h2><a id=\"user-content-configuration\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Configuration\" href=\"#configuration\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Stores → Configuration → Advanced → Inline Documentation</strong></p>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Setting</th>\n<th>Notes</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Enable Inline Documentation</td>\n<td>Off by default. Everything is served locally.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Show \"Full documentation\" Link</td>\n<td>Off by default. When on, a note that defines a URL also shows a link through to it.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Architecture</h2><a id=\"user-content-architecture\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Architecture\" href=\"#architecture\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong><code>inline_docs.xml</code> config type</strong> — <code>Model/Config/{Reader,Converter,SchemaLocator,Data}</code>\nparse, validate, merge and cache every module's notes into one id-keyed map.</li>\n<li><strong><code>Model/InlineDocProvider</code></strong> — resolves a page's element ids to their cards from\nthat map. No network, no token; a miss simply returns nothing.</li>\n<li><strong><code>Controller/Adminhtml/Inline/Fetch</code></strong> — one request per page returns the\ncards for the ids on it.</li>\n<li><strong><code>view/adminhtml/web/js/inline-docs.js</code></strong> — renders the marker and the card\n(hover to open, click to pin). The <code>usage</code> HTML is rebuilt client-side from a\nwhitelist of inline tags, so a note can never inject script or markup.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Every failure path returns empty and logs. A documentation aid must never break\nthe screen it decorates.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">License</h2><a id=\"user-content-license\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: License\" href=\"#license\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">MIT — see <a href=\"LICENSE\">LICENSE</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Previous Version UI</h2><a id=\"user-content-previous-version-ui\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Previous Version UI\" href=\"#previous-version-ui\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/12799619/665695429-c48b7726-4f70-42c9-9eac-9b9ebf3464df.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..0smXL4KodFvhzsjjUyz5aDJb0HYhN-dOL_rsF8f3WBk\"><img width=\"1077\" height=\"482\" alt=\"inline_docs\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/12799619/665695429-c48b7726-4f70-42c9-9eac-9b9ebf3464df.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..0smXL4KodFvhzsjjUyz5aDJb0HYhN-dOL_rsF8f3WBk\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 482px;; aspect-ratio: 1077 / 482; background-color: var(--bgColor-muted); border-radius: 6px\" class=\"js-gh-image-fallback\"></a>\n</article></div>"
}
